<%#
  A year marker over its rows. The year is a measurement, so it is mono; it is
  a marker rather than a heading, so it is small. Groups are separated by the
  `Stack` on the page — the rules that used to bound them were doing work the
  space already does, and one rule per group plus one per row made an archive
  of fifty posts read as a table.
%>

<section>
  <h2 class="m-0 mb-3 font-mono text-label text-mauve-11 tabular-nums">
    <%= @title %>
  </h2>

  <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 min-w-0">
    <%= content %>
  </div>
</section>
